  analysisNotes: 'V2: variable-tempo metric pulses refined to percussion leading
    attack edges using 1.995ms multiband spectral flux. Not a fixed BPM grid or manually
    certified downbeat map. Unity PCM alignment: 24 ms, applied once. 200ms shot
    window (+/-100ms). Two weak Fishing pulses retain constrained tracker timing.
    Individual click/output latency can be calibrated on RhythmConductor.'
